{"hymn":"S847","parent":"E1005","quality":"adapted","adjust":{"hold":0,"merge":4},"title":"Mi Redentor murió en la cruz","subtitle":"El evangelio—La sangre","syl":{"n1":"Mi","n2":["Re","i"],"n3":["den","m"],"n4":["tor","t"],"n5":["mu","i"],"n6":["rió","t"],"n7":"en","n8":"la","n9":"cruz,","n10":["To","i"],"n11":["das","t"],"n12":"las","n13":["deu","i"],"n14":["das","t"],"n15":["nues","i"],"n16":["tras","t"],"n17":["pa","i"],"n18":["gó;","t"],"n19":["Cuan","i"],"n20":["do","t"],"n21":"la","n22":["san","i"],"n23":["gre","t"],"n24":"se","n25":"ve","n26":"por","n27":["se","i"],"n28":["ñal,","t"],"n29":["So","i"],"n30":["bre","t"],"n31":["vo‿so","i"],"n32":["tros","t"],"n33":["pa","i"],"n34":["sa","m"],"n35":["rá","t"],"n36":["Di","i"],"n37":["os.","t"],"n39":"Si‿la","n40":["san","i"],"n41":["gre","t"],"n42":"ve","n43":"Dios,","n44":"Si‿la","n46":["san","i"],"n47":["gre","t"],"n48":"ve","n49":"Dios,","n51":"Si‿la","n52":["san","i"],"n53":["gre","t"],"n54":"ve","n55":"Dios,","n56":["Pa","i"],"n57":["sa","m"],"n58":["rá","t"],"n59":["so","i"],"n60":["bre","t"],"n61":["vo","i"],"n62":["so","m"],"n63":["tros","t"],"n64":"hoy."},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["A los más malos, Dios salvará;","Lo que Él promete, lo cumplirá;","Pongan su fe en la sangre eficaz;","Sobre vosotros, Dios pasará."]},{"label":"3.","lines":["Nadie podrá del juicio escapar,","Un justo pago a todos dará;","Hay que creer en la sangre triunfal,","Sobre vosotros, Dios pasará."]},{"label":"4.","lines":["¡Qué compasión! ¡Oh qué gran amor,","Benevolencia y fidelidad!","Bajo Su sangre albérguense hoy","Sobre vosotros, Dios pasará."]}]}